== identity S_i = SAW_minmax_i - B,  B = sum_j w_j (GM_i(1 + t_ij) - 1)
  F1: B = 0.471585 (spread 1.7e-16); mean SAW_mm 0.514335 >= B; rank(S) == rank(SAW_mm): True
  F2: B = 0.575196 (spread 2.2e-16); mean SAW_mm 0.605801 >= B; rank(S) == rank(SAW_mm): True
  F3: B = 0.468634 (spread 0.0e+00); mean SAW_mm 0.513093 >= B; rank(S) == rank(SAW_mm): True
  random 2000 (m 2-8, n 2-7, Dirichlet w, mixed types): max spread of SAW_mm - S 4.4e-16; ranking differs 0/2000; min(mean SAW_mm - B) 2.69e-02 (>= 0: AM-GM); max S > 0 in 2000/2000
== invariances
  per-column x -> a x + b (a > 0, |b| <= 1000, negatives in data): max|dS| 1.3e-15 over 1000
  one column x -> 60 / x with benefit<->cost swapped (origin IFC case 2): ranking changes in 347/1000
  complement x -> C - x with type swap (IFC case 1) is affine with a < 0 + type swap: S identical by construction
== edge cases
  constant column: q column zeros True; t=0 vs t=1 (pymcdm/pyrepo): max|dS| 5.6e-17; vs dropping the column: 0.0e+00
  zero weight: v = 0, G = 0.0, q column zeros True; S equals without it: 0.0e+00
  all alternatives equal: S = [0.000, 0.000, 0.000, 0.000] (all tie at 0)
  single alternative: t = [[0.0, 0.0]], S = [0.0] (meaningless; blocked by MIN_ALTERNATIVES)
  negative/zero raw values: S = [-0.2444, 0.2206, 0.1956] (min-max, no restriction)
  m = 2: G / w = [1.414214, 1.414214] (sqrt 2 = 1.414214); S = [-0.1142, 0.2858], sum S = 0.1716 = (3 - 2 sqrt 2) * sum w = 0.1716
